menu "Touch Boost Drivers"
	depends on AW_BSP

config AW_TOUCH_BOOST
       tristate "Allwinner touch boost Support"
       depends on AW_BSP && CPU_FREQ
       default n
       help
	 Support touch boost driver.If you need boost cpufreq when you
	 touch the touchscreen,say Yes to support this feature.

config AW_AMU_CPUFREQ
       tristate "Allwinner AMU(Acitivity monitor unit) cpufreq "
       depends on AW_BSP && CPU_FREQ
       default n
       help
	 Support aw amu cpufreq.If the cpu support amu(eg,A76),you could
	 enable this feature.The driver would monitor cpu cycles/instructions
	 and mem stall cycles, which could reduce cpu frequency for lower power
endmenu
